### Advisory hardening (do before a public/scaled launch, not before closed beta)
- [ ] [CLAUDE] Move the edge-function rate limiter to a shared store (Redis/Upstash or a
      Postgres RPC). Today it's in-memory per-isolate (_shared/rate-limit.ts) — the code itself
      says this is "good enough for the soft launch." Needed at ~100k users.
- [ ] [CLAUDE] Add abuse throttling to `join_school_by_code` (11_departments.sql) — 8-hex join
      codes are brute-forceable; add a join_attempts table + per-user rate check. Design choice,
      flagging rather than silently patching.
- [ ] [CLAUDE] Webhook responses still include `details:` error text — low risk (recipient is the
