## 📦 DEPLOY RUNBOOK (what I run once you give me the access token)

```
# 1. Apply schema to dev (idempotent, 00→12). Needs a DB connection string with password,
#    OR I use `supabase db push` after linking. I'll confirm the exact path with the token.
cd database-setup && ./apply.sh "postgresql://postgres:<db-pass>@<host>:5432/postgres"

# 2. Deploy every edge function
supabase functions deploy generate-activity paymongo-webhook stripe-webhook \
  create-checkout-session create-paymongo-checkout extract-text username-login delete-account

# 3. Set secrets (I fill these once you hand me the values)
supabase secrets set GEMINI_API_KEY=... QWEN_API_KEY=... \
  PAYMONGO_WEBHOOK_SECRET=... PAYMONGO_TIER1_PLAN_ID=... PAYMONGO_TIER2_PLAN_ID=... \
  STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=... STRIPE_TIER1_PRICE_ID=... STRIPE_TIER2_PRICE_ID=... STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=...

# 4. In the PayMongo + Stripe dashboards: register the webhook URLs (I give you the URLs),
#    copy the signing secrets back to me for step 3.
```

